<title>USA: SYMONS COMPLETES INSURANCE ACQUISITION.</title>
<headline>SYMONS COMPLETES INSURANCE ACQUISITION.</headline>
<dateline>INDIANAPOLIS 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Symons International Inc said Tuesday it completed the acquisition of the remaining 48 percent interest in its nonstandard automobile insurance business.</p>
<p>The company also closed its $135 million offering of 30 year trust preferred securities, which carry a 9.5 percent coupon and are initially callable in 2007.</p>
<p>Proceeds were used to buy the remaining stake in the auto insurance business, pay off outstanding term debt and increase working and acquisition capital, the company said.</p>
<p>Symons shares closed down 1/8 at 17-7/8 Tuesday.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787)) Tuesday, 12 August 1997 22:26:28 ENDS  nN12139984</p>
